## Volume, mass, ppm and ODT accounting

Reported-volume arithmetic: 30.000+0.240+0.060=30.300 mL nominally. The historical material rows4.900mL plus25.000mL ethanol give29.900mL; their component-sum successor is30.200mL. The user's reported30mL is the scaling input. No unreported top-up, exact density or volume contraction is invented.

Added-volume concentrations: Florol7,920.792ppm v/v and Nympheal1,980.198ppm v/v. These are not w/w concentrate ppm or vapor ppm. Stock masses in grams: dF=0.240*rhoF, dN=0.060*rhoN for densities in g/mL. Active masses: aF=pF*dF, aN=pN*dN for lot purities p. Concentrate ppm w/w=1e6*a_i/(measured_parent_concentrate_mass+dF+dN); finished ppm uses measured_parent_finished_mass instead. Density, purity and parent masses are not measured here; exact quantitative authority remains unavailable.

Local air ODTs: Florol10ppb=0.010ppm, Nympheal2ppb=0.002ppm, both UNVERIFIED. Florol localMW154.25 conflicts with supplierSDS172.26/manufacturerpage173. Nympheal localVP0.01Paat25C differs from manufacturer0.001hPa=0.1Pa at unstated tabletemperature. Florol localVP0.007Paat25C versus manufacturer0.00712Paat20C has a temperature-condition mismatch. No shared-data edits or silent substitutions are made. Matrix-omitted headspace OAV cannot establish comparative smell strength, masking, percent muguet, layering or reference similarity. New rows have no finite parent OAV fold.

## Isolated trial and nonredundancy

A separate5.000mL untreated portion receives the proposed Florol40microlitres neat and Nympheal10microlitres neat, nominal5.050mL. Use suitable calibrated equipment, not drops. If10microlitres cannot be delivered reliably, do not round up; design a labeled dilution and its carrier accounting first.

Keep an untreated reference. Once handling checks permit, compare separate coded blotters with equal application amounts/preparation ages at0/5/30minutes and2/4hours. No skin-use or spray-use clearance is asserted. Reject soapiness, detached floral density, citrus suppression or no useful improvement.

To test whether Nympheal earns its place, a separate matched-volume Florol-only design is5mLparent+40microlitresFlorol+10microlitresdeclaredsameparentvehicle; a vehicleblank is5mLparent+50microlitresofthatvehicle. These are unexecuted control designs, not included in the current pipeline run. Their withdrawals change the remainder.

After exactly one5mL withdrawal from exactly30mL, an otherwise untouched25mL remainder scales toFlorol200microlitres+Nympheal50microlitres, nominal25.250mL. For RmL untreated parent, the rule is8RmicrolitresFlorol+2RmicrolitresNympheal. Never reapply to treated material or automatically return the sample.

## Sources and limits

[Florol manufacturer](https://studio.dsm-firmenich.com/product/florolr-pe-966458) supports soft fresh muguet/floral diffusion. [Nympheal manufacturer](https://www.givaudan.com/fragrance-beauty/fragrance-ingredients-business/fragrance-molecules/nympheal) supports watery/green floral density and creaminess. Neither source validates the selected amounts.

[Florol supplier SDS](https://www.perfumersworld.com/document-list.php?ifra=defaultOpen3&pro_id=3ML00192) and [Nympheal supplier SDS](https://www.perfumersworld.com/document-list.php?ifra=defaultOpen3&pro_id=3MA22553) match local catalog SKUs, not verified current-lot assays. Use suitable eye/skin protection and ventilation; avoid concentrated contact/mist and ignition sources. The initially returned Nympheal certificate cites50thAmendment2021. Supplier certificates and use ranges are not current finished-formula clearance.

Inherited stock-basis, Lavender coverage, exact-mass and named-reference gaps remain. Coumarin20%DEP ownership is retained despite stale machine records. Safety/release HOLD; sensory effect, stability and strict similarity NOT TESTED. The fresh bound analysis follows; historical files are preserved.

